Hongkong Post e-Cert SSL CA 3 - 17, issued by Hongkong Post Root CA 3.
open.hkmapservice.gov.hk, where build.py downloads the iB5000 sheets, leaves
this intermediate out of its certificate chain. Browsers and macOS fetch it
themselves; Python doesn't, so build.py adds it to the system's trusted roots.
Valid until 2032-06-03.
